[h1]Daily Interest 2.0[/h1]

[b]This mod provides players with interest rewards based on their current currency balance at the end of each game day.[/b]
[b]Note that cash does not generate interest: you need to save money first![/b]

[h2]Features:[/h2]
[list]
[*] Automatically calculates and adds interest to your account daily.
[*] The daily interest rate is 0.5% (compounded).
[*] No configuration needed, it just works!
[*] Version 2.0 brings more scenario-based text to enrich your experience.
[/list]

[h3]Fully Supported Languages:[/h3]
[list]
[*] Simplified Chinese
[*] Traditional Chinese
[*] English
[*] Japanese
[*] Korean
[/list]

[h3]Partially Supported Languages:[/h3]
All other languages supported by the game

[b]If you enjoy this mod, please consider giving it a [i]RATE[/i].[/b]